# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  PUBLISH BOUNDARY
#
#  This repo ships the *tooling* (dashboard, schema, runtime protocol) and ONE
#  original, copyright-free example adventure. Everything else stays local:
#    • Copyrighted adventure source material (MCDM / WotC PDFs + extracted text)
#    • Real campaign adaptations (contain player names + session-by-session play)
#
#  When in doubt, it stays out. Run `git status` before every commit.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Copyrighted PDFs and anything derived from them, anywhere in the tree
*.pdf

# Default-deny every adventure folder, then re-allow ONLY the shippable example.
/adventures/*/
!/adventures/example_thornwell/

# Your private manifest — lists the real, unpublished adventures for local use
/adventures/manifest.local.js

# Source books, research, prior-art extracts
/reference/

# Real-session artifacts (player data)
/fact_check_reports/
/screengrab/
/NEXT_SESSION_PLAN_*.md
/cascades/

# Book fonts copied from the local Homebrewery install (see setup-fonts.ps1) —
# not redistributed here for license caution
/fonts/

# Tooling scratch
/.playwright-mcp/

# OS / editor cruft
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Local agent state / Python cache
/.claude/
__pycache__/
